	"descriptionMarkdown": "Addon for DocJade's The Automall and possibly others too. Allows you to craft fluid dependant recipe.\n\nDetailed info see: https://factorioprints.com/view/-Om7dse6tY2a1sN4zE01\n\nBiggest difference: Less prone to clogging and can use more than 7 type fluid before needing to a tank purge.\n\nSet-up: \n1) Remove all the fluid condition in the decider combinator with the 2 \"Anything\" signal in the Automall to enable crafting recipe that need fluid. Do not remove the Anything condition.\n2) Use 2 separate green wire to connect each decider combinator with \"Water\" signal to Assembler/crafting machine.\n3) Read crafter ingredients.\n\n6 tanks version: https://factorioprints.com/view/-OmHAZ_jeAAdYMXM4Tt-\n\nMulti-fluid version: https://factorioprints.com/view/-OmI89wy-71qUvZtsNti\n\nDocJade's Automall: https://blueprints.docjade.com/",
